on mouseUp
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 99 ........................... <the frame>
  [  5] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  8] add ..................................... <the frame + 1>
  [  9] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 11] extcall 100 ............................. go(the frame + 1)
  [ 14] ret
end
